  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Armenia Refugee Crisis: Resilience for All</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Amid the refugee crisis, national institutions face capacity gaps in ensuring effective refugee integration and protection. Enhanced access to justice, efficient free legal aid mechanisms, and strengthened capacities of national human rights institutions (NHRIs) are critical for safeguarding refugee rights. UNDP interventions aim to strategically address these areas to support the effective integration and protection of refugees in this critical phase of the Refugee Crisis.</narrative>
  </description>
